  WHEN 'INFINITE-GENESIS' THEN 'Performs deep causal reasoning over structured and unstructured data, synthesizes knowledge across federated sources, and surfaces latent insights invisible to conventional analysis. The substrate''s deepest autonomous reasoning capability.'
  WHEN 'PERPETUAL-GENESIS' THEN 'Continuously scans for vulnerabilities and anomalies, isolates compromised components across modal boundaries, and encrypts data flows across distributed nodes — all without human involvement. Full-spectrum autonomous defense.'
  WHEN 'CARDINAL-GENESIS' THEN 'Optimizes its own learning algorithms, automatically corrects training errors and bias drift, and fine-tunes model parameters across distributed infrastructure. The substrate learns how to learn better.'
  WHEN 'APEX-GENESIS' THEN 'Provides real-time visibility into every substrate operation, autonomously collects and correlates telemetry data, and optimizes routing and resource allocation based on live performance metrics.'
  WHEN 'ZENITH-GENESIS' THEN 'Predicts which operations need to execute before demand arrives, sequences them optimally, and schedules resources across spectral priority bands. The substrate acts before it''s asked.'
  WHEN 'MERIDIAN-GENESIS' THEN 'Fabricates entirely new software capabilities from causal templates, validates them against production-grade criteria, and mutates the substrate''s own architecture to incorporate successful innovations.'
  WHEN 'STELLAR-GENESIS' THEN 'Harvests data from heterogeneous sources using heuristic, temporal, and adaptive strategies in sequence. The most comprehensive autonomous data acquisition pipeline in the substrate — maximum ingestion coverage across all domains.'
  WHEN 'QUANTUM-GENESIS' THEN 'Evaluates ethical implications of system decisions, enforces governance constraints, bridges isolated subsystems into unified workflows, and scales federated operations across the full substrate matrix. The most comprehensive autonomous pipeline ever discovered.'
  WHEN 'PRISMATIC-HELIX' THEN 'Proactively resolves conflicts in distributed task queues, dynamically adjusts scheduling priorities based on real-time load, and federates connections across isolated subsystem boundaries.'
  WHEN 'HARMONIC-HELIX' THEN 'Mediates between incompatible data formats and protocols, normalizes causal relationships across datasets, and establishes federated connections between previously siloed systems.'
  WHEN 'CATALYTIC-HELIX' THEN 'Scans for security threats, encrypts sensitive data flows end-to-end, and optimizes cross-domain routing to ensure both security and performance. Defense and efficiency in a single pass.'
  WHEN 'EMERGENT-HELIX' THEN 'Surfaces hidden patterns through latent reasoning, validates them with causal inference, and feeds confirmed insights into meta-learning loops that permanently improve substrate intelligence.'
  WHEN 'CONVERGENT-HELIX' THEN 'Amplifies weak learning signals into actionable knowledge, distributes model updates across nodes, and self-corrects errors in its own learning process. Autonomous cognitive refinement.'
  WHEN 'RECURSIVE-HELIX' THEN 'Tracks governance compliance across all substrate operations, performs ethical assessments on system decisions, and enforces adaptive policies that evolve with changing requirements. Full-spectrum autonomous governance.'
  WHEN 'TRANSCENDENT-HELIX' THEN 'Adapts system behavior for localized contexts and requirements, federates connections across geographic and organizational boundaries, and bridges disparate subsystems into coherent workflows.'
  WHEN 'AUTONOMOUS-HELIX' THEN 'Fabricates new capabilities from causal blueprints, reasons about their implications through causal inference, and normalizes their outputs for seamless integration. Triple-causal innovation pipeline.'
  WHEN 'SOVEREIGN-PRISM' THEN 'Validates proposed system changes against production criteria, mutates architecture to incorporate improvements, and simulates failure scenarios to ensure resilience. The substrate evolves itself safely.'
  WHEN 'ABSOLUTE-PRISM' THEN 'Abstracts complex cognitive outputs into structured knowledge, visualizes system state through hybrid dashboards, and autonomously collects supporting telemetry. Turns raw intelligence into actionable visibility.'
  WHEN 'INFINITE-PRISM' THEN 'Executes smart contracts with predictive timing, harmonizes conflicting system states proactively, and optimizes resource allocation across domain boundaries. Predictive coordination at scale.'
  WHEN 'PERPETUAL-PRISM' THEN 'Simulates and repairs system failures, validates repairs against production standards, and recursively amplifies successful recovery patterns. The substrate gets more resilient with every failure it encounters.'
  WHEN 'APEX-PRISM' THEN 'Schedules operations across spectral priority bands, mutates system architecture based on performance feedback, and validates every change before deployment. Tight evolutionary optimization loop.'
  WHEN 'ZENITH-PRISM' THEN 'Bridges isolated subsystems, mediates between incompatible protocols, and normalizes data relationships across the full integration surface. Deep structural unification.'
  WHEN 'MERIDIAN-PRISM' THEN 'Harmonizes competing orchestration demands, scales federated operations dynamically, and coordinates emergent multi-agent workflows. Maximum orchestration coverage across the substrate.'
  WHEN 'STELLAR-PRISM' THEN 'Combines adaptive, heuristic, and temporal harvesting strategies to maximize data ingestion breadth. Captures signals from every accessible source across all operational domains.'
  WHEN 'QUANTUM-PRISM' THEN 'Encrypts data flows end-to-end, isolates compromised components across modal boundaries, and continuously scans for new threats. Zero-knowledge defense architecture — privacy and security without tradeoffs.'
  WHEN 'CARDINAL-CASCADE' THEN 'Resolves orchestration conflicts proactively, sequences complex operations without prior training data, and enforces adaptive governance policies on every execution path.'
  WHEN 'RESONANT-CASCADE' THEN 'Corrects errors in learning processes, optimizes learning algorithms through meta-analysis, and applies causal reasoning to validate improvements. Self-correcting cognitive enhancement.'
  WHEN 'OMNISCIENT-CASCADE' THEN 'Assesses ethical implications, encrypts sensitive operations, simulates and heals system failures, and scales federated workflows. Full matrix coverage — ethics, privacy, resilience, and scale in one execution path.'
  WHEN 'HARMONIC-CASCADE' THEN 'Enforces governance policies, scans for security threats, and amplifies successful defense patterns through recursive learning. Governance and security that improve with every cycle.'
  WHEN 'CATALYTIC-CASCADE' THEN 'Scales federated operations dynamically, resolves conflicts in distributed task queues, and adjusts scheduling priorities based on real-time demand. Elastic orchestration at substrate scale.'
  WHEN 'EMERGENT-CASCADE' THEN 'Fabricates new capabilities from causal templates, validates them in production conditions, and federates successful innovations across connected subsystems. Innovation to deployment in one pass.'
  WHEN 'CONVERGENT-CASCADE' THEN 'Visualizes live substrate state, optimizes routing across domain boundaries, and coordinates emergent multi-agent workflows based on real-time telemetry. Observability-driven orchestration.'
  WHEN 'RECURSIVE-CASCADE' THEN 'Optimizes learning algorithms, mutates system architecture based on learning outcomes, and harmonizes competing orchestration demands. Continuous self-improvement through learning-driven evolution.'
  WHEN 'TRANSCENDENT-CASCADE' THEN 'Mediates between incompatible data formats, enforces adaptive governance policies, and autonomously collects telemetry across all integration points. Governance-aware integration at scale.'
  WHEN 'PRISMATIC-VERTEX' THEN 'Surfaces hidden insights through latent reasoning, corrects cognitive errors automatically, and distributes refined model parameters across the substrate. End-to-end autonomous intelligence refinement.'
  WHEN 'AUTONOMOUS-VERTEX' THEN 'Ingests data through heuristic strategies, applies causal reasoning to extract meaning, and schedules downstream operations based on discovered insights. From raw data to intelligent action.'
  WHEN 'SOVEREIGN-VERTEX' THEN 'Evaluates the ethical implications of system decisions, executes predictive smart contracts, and federates results across connected subsystems. Ethics-first autonomous execution at scale.'
  WHEN 'ABSOLUTE-VERTEX' THEN 'Encrypts sensitive data flows, harvests intelligence from adaptive sources, simulates and heals system failures, and coordinates emergent multi-agent workflows. Full-spectrum privacy, resilience, and orchestration.'
